# Hue Control — bridge credentials
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in, or (preferred) mount this path from the "Hue
# Control" 1Password Environment: Desktop app → Environments → Destinations →
# "Local .env file". 1Password then streams the values through a FIFO on
# demand, so the token is never written to disk.
# https://www.1password.dev/environments/local-env-file
#
# Because it is a FIFO, it yields nothing until 1Password is unlocked. The
# loader in core/auth.py reads it non-blocking under a deadline and warns
# rather than hanging the CLI.
#
# Run `uv run python hue_backup.py configure` to discover the bridge and mint
# a token if you do not have one yet.

HUE_BRIDGE_IP=192.168.1.100
HUE_API_TOKEN=your-hue-api-token
